@BTH5_SOA_HostAddress = http://localhost:5206

### 1. Báo cáo tổng hợp (Doanh thu, Chi phí, Lợi nhuận, Tồn kho)
GET {{BTH5_SOA_HostAddress}}/api/Reports/summary
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Báo cáo theo sản phẩm
GET {{BTH5_SOA_HostAddress}}/api/Reports/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Báo cáo đơn hàng
GET {{BTH5_SOA_HostAddress}}/api/Reports/orders
Accept: application/json

###
